{"s0":"Add Central Asia to comparison","s1":"Compare","s2":"LOCAL TRANSFER SERVICE","s3":"Central Asia","s4":"central-asia.live","s5":"An easy start to your trip, with a name-sign welcome, flight monitoring and a ride to your accommodation.","s6":"Transfer details","s7":"Book on WhatsApp","s8":"Vehicles & booking details","s9":"Flight monitoring","s10":"Child seats on request","s11":"24/7 support","s12":"Sedans, minivans and SUVs. The published Bishkek options start at $18, $35 and $50 respectively. Confirm your luggage, waiting allowance and final total when booking. Free cancellation is listed up to 24 hours before pickup.","s13":"View published service information","s14":"Add Compass Transfer to comparison","s15":"TRANSFER CONTACT","s16":"Compass Transfer","s17":"Contact directly","s18":"Contact Compass Transfer to discuss your airport pickup or regional journey and request a price for your group.","s19":"Direct booking by phone","s20":"Call Compass","s21":"Direct phone contact","s22":"Vehicle options on request","s23":"Confirm your route","s24":"Contact supplied by the directory owner. Confirm route availability, vehicle size, luggage capacity, waiting policy and the total fare directly. No published price or website has been verified.","s25":"Add Manas Taxi to comparison","s26":"AIRPORT TAXI SERVICE","s27":"Manas Taxi","s28":"manastaxi.kg","s29":"Contact number updated by the directory owner.","s30":"Airport and intercity rides with published route prices, online booking and round-the-clock availability.","s31":"Contact provider","s32":"City & regional routes","s33":"Flight tracking","s34":"24/7 service","s35":"The provider lists sedans, minivans and premium transfer services. Route prices do not specify a vehicle category; ask for the fare for your chosen vehicle and whether meet-and-greet is included.","s36":"Contact source","s37":"Add Advantour to comparison","s38":"a","s39":"TOUR & TRANSPORT OPERATOR","s40":"Advantour","s41":"advantour.com","s42":"Pre-arranged private transfers with a choice of cars, vans and larger vehicles for group travel.","s43":"Group vehicle options","s44":"20-minute waiting allowance","s45":"Meet & greet","s46":"The Bishkek route lists sedans, SUVs, minivans, minibuses and buses. Book at least one business day before arrival. Confirm flight-delay arrangements and the final price for your party.","s47":"View published route prices","s48":"Add Kyrgyz Concept to comparison","s49":"KC","s50":"TRAVEL & TRANSPORT COMPANY","s51":"Kyrgyz Concept","s52":"kyrgyzconcept.kg","s53":"Airport and regional transfers with a designated meeting point, luggage assistance and a range of vehicles.","s54":"Request a quote","s55":"Name-sign pickup","s56":"2-hour flight-delay wait","s57":"Luggage assistance","s58":"The published fleet includes minivans, SUVs and minibuses. Two hours of waiting for a delayed flight are listed as free. Request vehicle availability, luggage capacity and a route-specific quote.","s59":"Add WelcomeTaxi to comparison","s60":"W","s61":"TRANSFER BOOKING SERVICE","s62":"WelcomeTaxi","s63":"welcome.taxi","s64":"Pre-book airport pickups and journeys to Karakol or Issyk-Kul through an international transfer booking service.","s65":"Get an online quote","s66":"Online booking","s67":"Karakol & lakeside routes","s68":"Vehicle choice when booking","s69":"Enter your route, date, passengers and luggage in the booking form to see available vehicles. Confirm meet-and-greet and waiting charges. The listed phone is the UK customer support number; local driver details are supplied with the booking.","s70":"WelcomeTaxi service information","s71":"Add C.A.T. Company to comparison","s72":"CAT","s73":"C.A.T. Company","s74":"cat.kg","s75":"A Bishkek travel company offering Manas Airport transfers and transport arrangements around Kyrgyzstan.","s76":"Call for a quote","s77":"Airport transfers","s78":"Regional transport enquiries","s79":"Group transport enquiries","s80":"Contact the transport team for a route-specific quote, available vehicle sizes and inclusions. The company lists transport throughout Kyrgyzstan; confirm availability for your Karakol or Cholpon-Ata trip. No current transfer fare was verified.","s81":"C.A.T. Company service information","s82":"Skip to transfer booking","s83":"Central Asia home","s84":"central asia","s85":"GO FURTHER. FEEL CLOSER.","s86":"Main navigation","s87":"Routes & prices","s88":"Compare companies","s89":"FAQs","s90":"Book a transfer","s91":"Breadcrumb","s92":"Home","s93":"Kyrgyzstan","s94":"PRIVATE AIRPORT TRANSFERS · KYRGYZSTAN","s95":"Manas Airport","s96":"transfers,","s97":"made easy.","s98":"Start your Kyrgyzstan journey with a ride that suits you. Compare transfer companies for trips from Manas Airport to Bishkek, Karakol and Cholpon-Ata. Explore starting fares and vehicle options, then contact your chosen company directly.","s99":"AI-generated illustration of a traveler approaching a minivan outside an airport","s100":"AI-generated travel illustration","s101":"From Manas Airport · with Central Asia","s102":"Destination","s103":"Bishkek city","s104":"Karakol","s105":"Cholpon-Ata","s106":"Vehicle","s107":"Help me choose","s108":"Sedan","s109":"Minivan","s110":"SUV","s111":"Your name","s112":"Full name","s113":"Arrival date","s114":"Arrival time","s115":"(Kyrgyzstan time)","s116":"Passengers","s117":"Suitcases","s118":"Flight number","s119":"(optional)","s120":"e.g. KC 109","s121":"Hotel or drop-off address","s122":"Hotel name or full address","s123":"Extra requirements","s124":"Child seats, ski equipment, extra stops…","s125":"Opens WhatsApp with your trip details. Send the message to confirm availability and the final price.","s126":"Your WhatsApp draft is ready. Your booking is confirmed only after our team replies.","s127":"Continue to WhatsApp","s128":"To send the form details, enable JavaScript. You can also","s129":"contact Central Asia on WhatsApp","s130":"and share your trip details directly.","s131":"PLAN YOUR AIRPORT JOURNEY","s132":"Airport transfer routes & starting prices","s133":"Private transfers to the city, the mountains or Issyk-Kul. Central Asia’s published route starting fares are below; confirm your exact vehicle and total when booking.","s134":"AI-generated illustration of a transfer car on a tree-lined boulevard inspired by Bishkek","s135":"Manas Airport to Bishkek","s136":"Give the provider your exact hotel or apartment address. Ask whether the fare covers that address, airport parking, meet-and-greet and waiting after landing. The drive into central Bishkek usually takes 30–50 minutes depending on traffic.","s137":"Central Asia · from $18 per transfer","s138":"Book a Bishkek transfer","s139":"Compare Bishkek transfers","s140":"AI-generated lakeside road scene inspired by the journey toward Karakol","s141":"Manas Airport to Karakol","s142":"For a longer transfer, confirm rest stops and luggage capacity. Mention ski equipment or trekking bags when requesting your vehicle and quote. The route around the eastern end of Issyk-Kul takes roughly 5–7 hours.","s143":"Central Asia · from $160 per transfer","s144":"Book a Karakol transfer","s145":"Compare Karakol transfers","s146":"AI-generated illustration of a minivan approaching Issyk-Kul’s northern shore near Cholpon-Ata","s147":"Manas Airport to Cholpon-Ata","s148":"Share the name and address of your accommodation. Confirm whether your destination is in Cholpon-Ata or a different lakeside town before agreeing on the fare. Allow around 3–4 hours for the drive to the northern shore.","s149":"Central Asia · from $120 per transfer","s150":"Book a Cholpon-Ata transfer","s151":"Compare Cholpon-Ata transfers","s152":"Compare starting prices from all seven companies","s153":"Airport route price comparison, scroll horizontally on smaller screens","s154":"Manas Airport departures · checked 12 September 2026 · starting prices in USD","s155":"Request quote","s156":"Source: each company’s linked transfer page above. These are not live quotes or like-for-like vehicle offers. Manas Taxi also publishes KGS prices; the USD amounts shown here are its listed equivalents.","s157":"EXPLORE YOUR OPTIONS","s158":"How it works","s159":"YOUR SELECTED JOURNEY","s160":"Manas Airport to","s161":"published fares","s162":"quotes on request","s163":"Compare companies side by side","s164":"Select up to three companies to compare.","s165":"Compare selected (","s166":"Copy route link","s167":"Copy trip enquiry","s168":"Text to copy","s169":"Your transfer shortlist","s170":"Close comparison","s171":"Selected transfer company comparison","s172":"These are starting amounts, not confirmed reservations. Request a total for the same vehicle and trip details from each provider.","s173":"companies","s174":"· Manas Airport to","s175":"Sort by","s176":"Default order","s177":"Name: A–Z","s178":"Starting price: low to high","s179":"Central Asia is our service. Compass Transfer is second in the default order. Placement is not a customer rating.","s180":"Prices are published starting amounts, not live quotes. Vehicle, destination, waiting time and extras may change your total. USD amounts are as listed by each provider.","s181":"Showing all seven providers for Manas Airport to Bishkek. Enable JavaScript to filter routes, vehicles and prices.","s182":"HOW BOOKING WORKS","s183":"How to book your airport transfer","s184":"Share your trip","s185":"Choose your route and enter your arrival time, passengers and drop-off address.","s186":"Send on WhatsApp","s187":"Select “Book a transfer” to open a WhatsApp draft with all the details you entered. Review it and send it to Central Asia.","s188":"Confirm your pickup","s189":"Our team confirms availability, your total fare and the meeting point. Save the agreed pickup details.","s190":"GOOD TO KNOW BEFORE YOU GO","s191":"Manas Airport transfer questions","s192":"Prices, booking details and what to confirm before you travel.","s193":"What is included in my transfer?","s194":"Central Asia lists flight monitoring and name-sign pickup, with child seats available on request. Confirm luggage space, airport parking, waiting time, any extra stops, payment currency and cancellation terms when agreeing on your total fare.","s195":"Am I booking with Central Asia or the provider?","s196":"The main booking form sends a WhatsApp draft to Central Asia. Your booking is confirmed after our team agrees on availability, the price and pickup details with you. The comparison cards also provide direct contacts for other companies.","s197":"Are these prices guaranteed?","s198":"No. These are starting prices published by the providers, checked on 12 September 2026. They are not live availability or final quotes. Confirm the vehicle, route, currency, waiting time and any extras before booking.","s199":"What should I send when booking?","s200":"Send your flight number, arrival date and time, destination address, passenger count and luggage details. Mention child seats or oversized equipment and ask for the final price and meeting point.","s201":"What if my flight is delayed?","s202":"Waiting policies vary. Some providers list flight tracking or a waiting allowance. Confirm the exact policy with your chosen company and share your flight number before arrival.","s203":"Book your airport transfer","s204":"Ready to arrange your pickup?","s205":"City stay, mountain adventure or time by Issyk-Kul? Tell Central Asia where you’re heading and request a pickup quote.","s206":"Local knowledge. More meaningful journeys.","s207":"Get in touch","s208":"Central Asia · GuideBook of Kyrgyzstan","s209":"Suggest a correction","s210":"Back to top","s211":"Language","s212":"Close navigation","s213":"Open navigation","s214":"Request your vehicle price","s215":"{destination} · from ${price} per transfer","s216":"Compare airport transfer companies","s217":"Compare {destination} transfers","s218":"Manas Airport to {destination}","s219":"Plan your journey to Karakol with a comparison of published fares and direct quotes. Ask about rest stops, skis or large bags, and your hotel’s exact address.","s220":"Compare transfers to Cholpon-Ata on Issyk-Kul. Share your hotel or resort address, luggage and passenger count to get a complete quote.","s221":"Three selected. Remove one to choose another company.","s222":"Choose one more company to compare.","s223":"Copy the selected text below:","s224":"Please enter your name.","s225":"Please enter your hotel or drop-off address.","s226":"Enquiry copied. Paste it into your provider’s booking form or message.","s227":"Route link copied. Personal trip details are not included.","s228":"Confirm route & vehicle availability","s229":"Confirm with the provider","s230":"Provider also lists {amount} KGS","s231":"Published route starting fare","s232":"Published {vehicle} fare","s233":"For your journey","s234":"Starting from","s235":"Get a quote","s236":"Confirm vehicle availability","s237":"{vehicle} listed; confirm for this route","s238":"Quote required","s239":"Starting fare","s240":"Phone","s241":"Booking","s242":"Enquire on WhatsApp","s243":"Request an online quote","s244":"Any suitable vehicle","s245":"Bishkek","s246":"Manas Airport Transfers to Bishkek | Compare 7 Companies","s247":"Compare 7 Manas Airport transfer companies for Bishkek, Karakol and Cholpon-Ata. Explore starting prices and vehicles, then contact your chosen provider directly.","s248":"AI-generated illustration of an airport pickup","s249":"We'll suggest a vehicle from your passenger and luggage details.","s250":"Manas Airport transfers to Bishkek & beyond","s251":"Your trip, your choice of company. Compare published starting prices, vehicle options and pickup details from Central Asia, Compass Transfer, Manas Taxi and other providers. Shortlist up to three to compare side by side, then call, message or book through their website.","s252":"Choose a company in the comparison above to contact it directly. For a transfer with Central Asia, use the form and follow these three steps.","s253":"Request your transfer with Central Asia","s259":"How much is a transfer from Manas Airport to Bishkek?","s260":"Manas Taxi publishes a starting fare of {taxi} ({som} KGS) to central Bishkek; Central Asia’s sedan starts at {central}. These are provider-listed starting prices, not a single airport tariff. Compare the same vehicle, drop-off address, luggage and waiting terms before choosing.","s261":"Should I book a sedan, minivan or SUV?","s262":"Tell the provider how many people and bags are travelling, including children and oversized equipment. Passenger and luggage capacity vary by vehicle. An SUV does not necessarily carry more people than a minivan. Select “Help me choose” in the Central Asia form to request a suitable vehicle.","arrivalTitle":"Your Manas Airport pickup, step by step","arrivalIntro":"Arrange the details with your chosen company before you travel, then keep the confirmation handy when you land.","beforeFlightTitle":"Before you fly","beforeFlightBody":"Save your booking confirmation, the agreed fare and currency, and the company’s contact number. Ask for the exact meeting point and how to reach the driver if your flight changes.","afterLandingTitle":"When you land","afterLandingBody":"Collect your luggage and follow your provider’s meeting instructions. Confirm your name, destination and booking with the driver before loading your bags.","missingDriverTitle":"Can’t find your driver?","missingDriverBody":"Call or message the company using the contact saved with your booking. Describe where you are and agree on a meeting point before moving elsewhere.","nightArrivalQuestion":"Can I arrange a pickup after midnight?","nightArrivalAnswer":"Request your late-night pickup in advance and confirm driver availability. Use the arrival date and time in Kyrgyzstan, especially when your flight lands after midnight. For an onward transfer, also check when your accommodation can receive you.","onwardTitle":"Plan the rest of your trip","exploreDestination":"Explore {destination}","publisherText":"Published by Central Asia · GuideBook of Kyrgyzstan.","aboutPublisher":"About Central Asia"}